OL,3,GNEWSAFarewell to cross-Channel ferry
OL,4,Aafter three decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FListen back to BBC Radio Solent's
OL,7,FBreakfast in Dorset show as Brittany
OL,8,FFerries' Barfleur sails out of Poole
OL,9,Ffor the final time
OL,11,FThe operator has blamed high costs and
OL,12,Ffalling passenger numbers for the
OL,13,Fdecision to end the 34-year route to
OL,14,FCherbourg and sell the vessel
OL,16,FPeople gathered on the shoreline and on
OL,17,Fsmall boats to say farewell
OL,19,FThe ferry cast off its moorings at
OL,20,FPoole's ferry terminal a few minutes
OL,21,Fafter its 08:30 BST scheduled departure
OL,22,Ftime
